- Run commands listed in `sandbox.excludedCommands` (such as `git`, `hk`, and `pnpm`) as standalone Bash calls, without `&&`, `;`, pipes, or `$(...)`. The exclusion only applies when the whole command matches, so a combined command runs inside the sandbox and fails. For `git commit`, pass the message with one `-m` per paragraph instead of `"$(cat <<'EOF' ... EOF)"`.
